      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "まったく。\n風邪ひいちまうとは情けねー連中だ。\n鍛え方が足りないんだよ。鍛え方が。",
      "jp_sha256": "3e56f70ab5f887acccf229758581762c129a81e65703ea118aa2cff677fe03ef",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "정말이지.\n감기에나 걸리다니 한심한 녀석들이야.\n단련이 부족해. 단련이.",
      "message_index_0based": 1,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 9,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b001-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "841c5f81586cc0862d305b6fc4a035431e68f6a440bc5d2749288a8fe534109c:000000_-8635670516390342283:g0:r8",
      "row_index_0based": 8,
      "serialized_row_index": 8,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "イグニ",
        "Emt1_Nor",
        "layer_中",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
        "まったく。\n風邪ひいちまうとは情けねー連中だ。\n鍛え方が足りないんだよ。鍛え方が。",
        "",
        "ch_10010/R18/10010B0_10010_Nml/10010B0_10010_001",
        ""
      ],
      "speaker": "イグニ",
      "translation_status": "translated",
